# Deathly Ride (CR 715, 115.1): "Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand." Bot2 kills Bot1's Memnite; Bot1's Black Lotus, sacrificed for mana,
# is in the graveyard too but is no creature card (the refused target), so Ride takes the Memnite back to hand, the Horseman is exiled on an adventure
# (CR 715.3d), and Bot1 casts the Horseman from exile the same turn.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Memnite
Fell Horseman
Swamp x1
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
